  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Plumping</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A skincare-powered mist that hydrates, sets, and improves your skin overtime. <strong><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients:<br style=\" border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: inherit; font: inherit; text-transform: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; text-align: inherit; text-decoration: none; align-items: normal; min-width: 0px;\"></strong>- Polyglutamic Acid: Helps to instantly hydrate and plump the skin.</p><p>- Arginine: Helps to promote skin firmness, hydration and support the skins barrier.</p><p>- VP/VA Copolymer: A light film former which helps to keep your makeup in place.</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Shake: Shake well before use.<br>-Mist: For best results, hold 20&ndash;25 cm away from the face and hold down to mist slowly until face is evenly covered. Ensure eyes and mouth are closed.<br>-Apply: Use alone, before or after makeup.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Polyglutamic Acid: Rapidly hydrates and visibly plumps the skin. <br>-Arginine: Promotes visible skin firmness, hydrates, and supports the skin&rsquo;s barrier.<br>-VP/VA Copolymer: A light film former which keeps your makeup in place.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Propylene Glycol, Glycerin, VP/VA Copolymer, Babassu Oil Glycereth-8 Esters, Butylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Arginine, Sodium Polyglutamate, Citric Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Polyglutamic Acid, Laurtrimonium Chloride, Sodium Bisulfite, Ethylhexylglycerin.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Plumping</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A skincare-powered mist that hydrates, sets, and improves your skin overtime. <strong><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients:<br style=\" border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: inherit; font: inherit; text-transform: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; text-align: inherit; text-decoration: none; align-items: normal; min-width: 0px;\"></strong>- Polyglutamic Acid: Helps to instantly hydrate and plump the skin.</p><p>- Arginine: Helps to promote skin firmness, hydration and support the skins barrier.</p><p>- VP/VA Copolymer: A light film former which helps to keep your makeup in place.</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Shake: Shake well before use.<br>-Mist: For best results, hold 20&ndash;25 cm away from the face and hold down to mist slowly until face is evenly covered. Ensure eyes and mouth are closed.<br>-Apply: Use alone, before or after makeup.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Polyglutamic Acid: Rapidly hydrates and visibly plumps the skin. <br>-Arginine: Promotes visible skin firmness, hydrates, and supports the skin&rsquo;s barrier.<br>-VP/VA Copolymer: A light film former which keeps your makeup in place.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Propylene Glycol, Glycerin, VP/VA Copolymer, Babassu Oil Glycereth-8 Esters, Butylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Arginine, Sodium Polyglutamate, Citric Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Polyglutamic Acid, Laurtrimonium Chloride, Sodium Bisulfite, Ethylhexylglycerin.</div></details>",
